@excel
Feature: Excel cell-to-cell comparison # app/features/excel_cell_compare.feature:2
  As a report owner
  I want to compare two workbooks cell by cell
  So that unintended changes between report versions are caught
  @demo
  Scenario: Cosmetic differences are ignored                                         # app/features/excel_cell_compare.feature:8
    Given the excel compare config "app/datasets/cell_compare/sales_v1_vs_v2_ok.yml" # pyassure/steps/data_steps.py:302
    When I run the excel cell comparison                                             # pyassure/steps/data_steps.py:310
    And I generate the Excel comparison workbook                                     # pyassure/steps/data_steps.py:322
    Then both workbooks should contain the same sheets                               # pyassure/steps/data_steps.py:359
    And there should be no cell differences                                          # pyassure/steps/data_steps.py:368

